373e868f802e0f095bea9353282d9fdca5d1883d, enekocm7/cube-tui/crates/tnoodle-rs.
Includes TNoodle-lib puzzle and solver ports, including Levi Gibson FTO solver.
Upstream archive omitted its license file; repository GPLv3 text is included in
crates/tnoodle/LICENSE. Local changes and original reference are recorded there.

Player geometry: legacy Cubegin player adapters at 79a1e4c. Pyraminx, Skewb
and Megaminx reference cubing.js PuzzleGeometry static sticker coordinates and
move mappings, https://github.com/cubing/cubing.js, MPL-2.0 OR GPL-3.0-or-later
(GPL-3.0 option selected). No cubing.js or Three.js runtime is bundled.
Auxiliary solver transition/pruning tables and training case coordinates are
derived from the legacy GPL Cubegin/cstimer implementation; see crate data READMEs.
Cubegin is not an official WCA scramble program.
